<title>USA: Tate Cty, Miss., $1.25 mln, won by Duncan-Williams.</title>
<headline>Tate Cty, Miss., $1.25 mln, won by Duncan-Williams.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
